FishingPaper: {
	DisplayName: Lostbelt Journey Fishing Guide
	Tooltip:
		'''
		The Lostbelt Journey adds brand new catches, but due to the lack of a wiki
		Therefore, here is a guide note
		Before you can obtain the special catches added by Lostbelt Journey, you need to first obtain and equip [i:HJScarletRework/BitingClaw]Biting Claw
		Special Catch List:
		[i:HJScarletRework/DiverHead][i:HJScarletRework/DiverBody][i:HJScarletRework/DiverLegs]Diver Armor, obtained by fishing in the Ocean after defeating [i:EaterMask]Eater of Worlds / [i:BrainMask]Brain of Cthulhu
		[i:HJScarletRework/EthrealSwordfish]Eternal Swordfish, obtained in the Desert after defeating the Overwatcher
		[i:HJScarletRework/LivingReaverShark]Living Reaver Shark, obtained in the Jungle after defeating the Lifebringer
		[i:HJScarletRework/MatterSawtoothShark]Matter Sawtooth Shark, obtained in the Snow biome after defeating the Materializer
		[i:HJScarletRework/DarkenRockFish]Darken Rockfish, obtained Underground after defeating the Wall of Shadows
		'''
}
